OL,3,ATrump denies limiting Ukraine access to
OL,4,AStarlink network
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has denied
OL,7,Flimiting Ukraine's access to Starlink's
OL,8,Fsister internet network Starshield
OL,9,Fafter it restricted drone speed,
OL,10,Fhampering Kyiv's ability to protect
OL,11,Fitself from Russian attacks.
OL,13,F"It wasn't me and I don't think it was
OL,14,F[Starlink owner] Elon [Musk]," Trump
OL,15,Fsaid, hours after Ukrainian President
OL,16,FVolodymyr Zelensky said speed had yet
OL,17,Fto be restored.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
