OL,3,ATrump denies limiting Ukraine access to
OL,4,AStarlink network
OL,5,
OL,6,FMusk himself suggested the US
OL,7,Fgovernment might have been behind the
OL,8,Frestrictions, while Reuters news agency
OL,9,Freported on Thursday that the order had
OL,10,Fcome from inside the White House.
OL,12,FUkraine was hit by several deadly
OL,13,Fstrikes on Tuesday after the network
OL,14,Fslowdown.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
